{
    "title": "Wondery: Discover Podcasts",
    "description": "Discover free podcast series from Wondery, an Amazon company, where diverse worlds of storytelling await. Whether you're a crime enthusiast, a tech podcast fan, a history buff, or looking to laugh along to a comedy podcast, Wondery offers a personalized listening journey just for you. With our user-friendly app, available for free download, listen to podcasts that entertain, inform, and inspire.\r\n\r\nWhy choose Wondery for free podcast listening?\r\n\u2022 Discover a wide range of podcasts: enjoy true crime, tech, comedy and more podcasts across a multitude of genres\r\n\u2022 Personalized podcast listening: adjust playback speed, share episodes & set a sleep timer right from the podcast player\r\n\u2022 High-quality audio: experience podcasts with crystal-clear audio for the best listening experience\r\n\u2022 Binge-mode: Listen to all podcast episodes from the same series in order\r\n\r\nExplore our featured podcasts:\r\n\u2022 Morbid: enjoy a blend of dark comedy and serious crime podcast discussions that will keep you on the edge of your seat\r\n\u2022 New Heights: Jason and Travis Kelce serve up weekly insights, stories, and special guests for an insider\u2019s perspective to the NFL\r\n\u2022 Dr. Death: uncover the chilling world of medical malpractice and the dark side of the healthcare system with this gripping podcast\r\n\u2022 Armchair Expert: hosted by Dax Shepard and Monica Padman, a podcast that has a dose of humor, irreverence, and vulnerability\r\n\u2022 American Scandal: step into the scandals that have shaped America since its founding\r\n\u2022 RedHanded: unravel true crime stories with gripping narratives\r\n\u2022 This is Actually Happening: immerse yourself in real-life stories that defy belief, highlighting the depth of human experience\r\n\r\nWith Wondery+, you can download episodes for offline listening without the need for podcast streaming, so your favorite stories are always close at hand. Your Wondery+ subscription has perks including:\r\n\u2022 Early access: be the first to access new episodes of your favorite podcasts\r\n\u2022 Exclusive podcasts: unlock exclusive content and bonus episodes available only to Wondery+ subscribers\r\n\u2022 Ad-free podcast episodes: listen to your favorite podcasts uninterrupted\r\n\u2022 Live events: participate in live streams and connect with a community of listeners\r\n\u2022 Discounts on merchandise: get 15% off on all merchandise from the Wondery Shop\r\n\r\nJoin the Wondery community today and transform your daily routine with stories that resonate, entertain, and inform. From true crime podcast series to comedy podcasts, there's a Wondery show for every mood and moment. Ready to start listening to all the podcasts Wondery has for you? Download Wondery now.\r\n\r\nDownload the podcast app today and start exploring. Whether you\u2019re captivated by the complexity of true crime podcasts or seeking laughter in comedy podcasts, find your next podcast obsession on Wondery.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover free podcast series from Wondery, an Amazon company, where diverse worlds of storytelling await. Whether you&#39;re a crime enthusiast, a tech podcast fan, a history buff, or looking to laugh along to a comedy podcast, Wondery offers a personalized listening journey just for you. With our user-friendly app, available for free download, listen to podcasts that entertain, inform, and inspire.<br><br>Why choose Wondery for free podcast listening?<br>\u2022 Discover a wide range of podcasts: enjoy true crime, tech, comedy and more podcasts across a multitude of genres<br>\u2022 Personalized podcast listening: adjust playback speed, share episodes &amp; set a sleep timer right from the podcast player<br>\u2022 High-quality audio: experience podcasts with crystal-clear audio for the best listening experience<br>\u2022 Binge-mode: Listen to all podcast episodes from the same series in order<br><br>Explore our featured podcasts:<br>\u2022 Morbid: enjoy a blend of dark comedy and serious crime podcast discussions that will keep you on the edge of your seat<br>\u2022 New Heights: Jason and Travis Kelce serve up weekly insights, stories, and special guests for an insider\u2019s perspective to the NFL<br>\u2022 Dr. Death: uncover the chilling world of medical malpractice and the dark side of the healthcare system with this gripping podcast<br>\u2022 Armchair Expert: hosted by Dax Shepard and Monica Padman, a podcast that has a dose of humor, irreverence, and vulnerability<br>\u2022 American Scandal: step into the scandals that have shaped America since its founding<br>\u2022 RedHanded: unravel true crime stories with gripping narratives<br>\u2022 This is Actually Happening: immerse yourself in real-life stories that defy belief, highlighting the depth of human experience<br><br>With Wondery+, you can download episodes for offline listening without the need for podcast streaming, so your favorite stories are always close at hand. Your Wondery+ su